<title>SOUTH AFRICA: REBHOLD BUYS LIQUOR GROUP FOR 8.4 MLN RAND.</title>
<headline>REBHOLD BUYS LIQUOR GROUP FOR 8.4 MLN RAND.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rebhold Ltd said on Friday it had acquired Port Elizabeth-based Sip 'n Save Liquor Group for 8.44 million rand.</p>
<p>Of this, 4.79 million is payable in cash in December 1996 with the balance payable in November 1997.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
